{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "2c925020ccbc3c26aaffa564be12f45cda62d31baf41bdd1a3bd158e1d9c66a2", "ja": "恋を知らない乙女たち", "zh": "未尝恋果的少女们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "50751c7fcc8291deacf8d8402a1ce2e42c230d864551d86f8b2ce7278ffd76b7", "ja": "次の天体公演のユニット『ウィルゴ』に\n選ばれた静香、百合子、昴。恋を題材にした\n曲を歌うことになったが、肝心の恋がどんな\nものかわからない。まずは恋について知ろう\nと、3人で恋の研究を始める。", "zh": "静香、百合子、昴被选为『处女座』的成员，\n准备在下次的天体公演中演出。\n她们虽然要演唱情歌，却对曲中描绘的爱恋\n一无所知。三人决定先从理解爱情下手，\n开始研究起爱情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a227639e36b957e3021dbb729c5c974ba9c35e218afa1b755ed718da8e0f9691", "ja": "（さて、みんなはもう集まってるかな。\nいい曲をもらったし、早く聴かせたいな！）", "zh": "（好了，大家应该都到了吧。\n收到了这么棒的歌，真想赶快让她们听听！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "e27735c03c7f152aeeb166726bd0f96fb3c76e4719a4eaebde6eed7b7c484e04", "ja": "おっ、{$P$}だ！\nお疲れー。", "zh": "喔，是{$P$}！\n辛苦啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "d733210da6f4e1f77c02af50b2ad3ae07bba9c7aecbe7d7cd55355febdba9f30", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "f2f66543d39258a4baedf719ff3aca8419064f635a0c75d9bc997764cab2c224", "ja": "お疲れさまです。\n……{$P$}、話って何ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n……{$P$}，你找我们有什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "094b9e1464d91d07a1996e72d3ea41c933fcbdfb287ac9cd04c09cc375454496", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n今日集まってもらったのは、他でもない……。", "zh": "各位辛苦了！\n今天找你们来，不是为了别的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ae2bcfbb89241280c793e3b3f0cee56bc44f758ed0ad4ab9e71f979b5bc9c39b", "ja": "次の天体公演は、この3人に出てもらおうと思ってる。\nどうだ、やってくれるか？", "zh": "下次的天体公演，我想请你们三个上台演出。\n怎么样？你们愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "f6b93e1be1ba2521523fa4c05be5cf6291a75327e0f2239a9aa57703b62341f5", "ja": "えっ……！", "zh": "咦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "f6b93e1be1ba2521523fa4c05be5cf6291a75327e0f2239a9aa57703b62341f5", "ja": "えっ……！", "zh": "咦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "f6b93e1be1ba2521523fa4c05be5cf6291a75327e0f2239a9aa57703b62341f5", "ja": "えっ……！", "zh": "咦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "de1c54165730328103f38ef9c623613390899f9588316bb1b6e63878a00088ae", "ja": "あれ？　あんまり嬉しくないか……？", "zh": "咦？你们好像不怎么高兴的样子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "53d207d3e8a8b36b069832a6ec21c8fc4248a18fd232f4b8b82a096a1384f628", "ja": "いえっ、そんなことないです！\nちょっと、ビックリしちゃっただけで……。", "zh": "没有，怎么会呢！\n只是有点吓到而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "25264da31dc2f10cb78289b8a6e530a29e3f191fc95e17dc1a413b38ab705a86", "ja": "も、もちろんやります！　やらせてください！\n……みんなも、それでいい？", "zh": "我、我当然愿意！请让我上台！\n……你们也没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "4f9a9b5d4748d03cebfccc06eedf6c58c60a45a09cae087842a6f606614670a1", "ja": "ああ！　そっか、ついにオレ達の番か～。\n天体公演って、なんかカッコいいよな♪", "zh": "没问题！这回终于轮到我们啦～\n天体公演听起来很帅气呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "92026701b11d8dab9df59f78076b06defcb9f515056c9c6b187a8fe70c88b1e7", "ja": "昴さんも、そう思いますか？　天体公演には、\n私も特別な物語を感じているんです！", "zh": "昴也这样想吗？\n我也觉得天体公演带有一种特别的故事性呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "65901a0234110f441c67ace2a67cb50e09553094c764160d09e3020062ebc85d", "ja": "ありがとう、3人とも！　じゃあ早速だけど、\nみんなには、この曲を聴いてみてほしい。", "zh": "谢谢你们三个！那事不宜迟，\n我想先让你们听听这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "bdc1b50d391bcc2d4c3c629bf990252b24b9bbc63aff433002c834d0f270a220", "ja": "なんだか、とってもかわいくて、切なくて……\nこの曲のテーマって、恋……？　そうですよねっ！？", "zh": "听起来很可爱，却又让人觉得惆怅……\n这首歌的主题，是在讲爱情……？没错吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a286303a8a0a59ea897c1bd54368f14235dbb2b2ac2d84d2b251234b7be1fa60", "ja": "おお、流石は百合子だな。\nこの曲のテーマは、『恋』だ。", "zh": "喔喔，真不愧是百合子。\n这首歌的主题正是『爱情』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "11dc362b01176b2a382989b7e01f06894c2dc5dbd30f06d73c4b391423c7c378", "ja": "ええっ！？　恋かぁ～。\nう～ん……。", "zh": "咦咦！？爱情啊～\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "cfa67ba549534837f4a58cacb111dc2586e6d5f014f98285ac90a8d308eb72b9", "ja": "昴、どうかしたの？", "zh": "昴，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "672e60a620d7fabdc74f89a55b397e8f3bc5e67265b4bf6268ec7fac185b0a9a", "ja": "え？　だって……\nなあ、みんなは、恋ってしたことある？", "zh": "咦？就是……\n我想先问一下，你们谈过恋爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "684a962597e2de445512e0fbadb51dc52fcca00840699de3e3b9a6b912a5ee6d", "ja": "ええっ！？　こ、恋って、恋ですよね？\nそ、それは……ない、です、ね……。", "zh": "咦咦！？你、你是说恋爱对吧？\n这、这个嘛……没有呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "710999f35444c28f903559cb66840810e6dca7b5453443826adbae3aaff60aa1", "ja": "私もないけど……真剣にアイドルをしていたら、\n恋なんてしてるヒマもないし。", "zh": "我也没有……全心全意投注在偶像活动上，\n根本没空谈什么恋爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "09109668fb33e428db38c43c83f8ee9a2e430f79124523d44e1865310ac4c5f8", "ja": "うーん、オレもないんだよなぁ。\n普通、みんなするもんなのかな？", "zh": "嗯……我也是呢。\n一般来说，大家都会谈恋爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "986d197e9da07a6f1e94d87b80b123e24e9f8747d2ece7203f52ce3f2d5eb5e9", "ja": "まあ、人にもよるだろうけど……。\n無理にするものでもないからな。", "zh": "这个嘛，我想是因人而异……\n毕竟那种事也勉强不来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "1a38c21a7833df5c731bf631dff99e194cf2a1d4e0ef4d435c2e2ddbaeacd946", "ja": "でも、たしかに……恋のことを何も知らないのに、\nこの曲を歌い上げることが、できるんでしょうか。", "zh": "不过，这担心是对的……我们完全不晓得爱情是什么，\n真的能唱出这首歌的情怀吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "995e6333751274e7df3684d66ce88d8ebedac67b88226a09b5fb559a549cbf02", "ja": "私も、そんな表面だけで歌うのはイヤです。\n第一、曲にも、お客さんにも失礼だと思います。", "zh": "我也这么觉得，我不希望演唱时只是做做样子。\n更何况，这样不仅对不起这首歌，也对观众相当失礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "3854c873d2810f17e3d05cfeea9af4ca82db9732a623ea1050c671d17bc0255b", "ja": "ふむ……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "d6aa5b8f4a3857f0f9bb900cb9fbd59854168f7695532683d0e806fcbbe12497", "ja": "でも百合子は、本とかで\nいろいろ知ってるんじゃないのか？", "zh": "可是百合子，\n你看过不少书，应该挺有概念的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "12e8286fda4e655310bf8020008cafb44a3dc026acadc386f6b2b5f291d17c82", "ja": "い、いえ、昴さん！　私のは、本だけの知識ですから。\n本物の恋を知っているかというと……。", "zh": "哪、哪有，昴！我只是空有书本上的知识，\n这样哪算理解真正的爱情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "813cd3e4ba72110d30d00b16d64cc19e6a9453444afd6ecebc03844e01bc2a46", "ja": "うーん……。ダメだ、やっぱよくわかんない！\nなあ静香、百合子。オレ達、どうすればいいかな？", "zh": "嗯……不行，想来想去还是不懂！\n我说静香、百合子，我们该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "2078c30a4dcf96c195f8be439bc22e6c2aebde38c617e62e0f08717180d6fabc", "ja": "そうですね。この場合は、やっぱり……\nこ、恋の、研究をするべきじゃ……ないかと……。", "zh": "这个嘛，我想这种时候……\n还、还是该来研究一下……爱情是什么才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "69093c9fac16f761604d66ca91962dc849fb2c686802f73ca886e810b6290160", "ja": "恋の……研究？", "zh": "研究……爱情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1033_047sub", "source_sha256": "2a62b2b0f685474d486b7bc142c6c777cebfac9f612733f8b4937075a158776b", "ja": "って、何すんの？", "zh": "具体来说是要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca3d9af81b069898ea1188883b122e402c41e4da4b86747dc4615521928fda33", "ja": "わ、わからないから、研究するの！\nだって、それしかないじゃない！", "zh": "就、就是不知道才要研究啊！\n毕竟也没其他办法了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "a8f0baf23ea759a30af1a6bfa4134e454f26f9f06c31e43b63e18f2468754ad9", "ja": "なるほど。歌や演技について研究するみたいに、\n恋の歌を歌うために、恋の研究をすると……。", "zh": "原来如此，就像钻研唱功、演技那样，\n为了唱好情歌，所以要去研究爱情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "da63ef84e3835c2f169cf6bd9c2889aeb4c7ebd9e85a1602586c154fac205c3d", "ja": "そ、そういうことです！\n{$P$}！", "zh": "我、我就是这个意思！\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "ce487eb13092a1e46580645d89077a955d3f3ee43846f9c6c26ea1fb2bf15091", "ja": "恋の研究……わかりました！\nさっそく、資料になりそうな本を探さないと……！", "zh": "研究爱情……我明白了！\n我得马上去找可以参考的书才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "bd640352e919deb7c589be0a92eb7105e479741a3172ebab66fb429391f39f31", "ja": "あ……そうだ。3人のユニット名なんだけど、\n恋する乙女にちなんで、おとめ座という意味の……。", "zh": "啊……对了，关于你们三人的团体名称，\n我想呈现恋爱中少女的感觉，所以想用星座中的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "7f30967e427044b28699a938d61ab195e41b2d9d7bcedfedcb0657c511b9e954", "ja": "ウィルゴ、というのはどうだろう？\nピッタリだと思うんだけど。", "zh": "Virgo，也就是『处女座』来当团名，你们觉得怎么样？\n我自己是觉得非常适合啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1040_047sub", "source_sha256": "4fc8a2cc1ff8f906098c85fc8609a854808bff35f000788f07a84e07be0c795b", "ja": "ウィルゴ！？　うわー！　なんか助っ人選手みたいで\nカッコイイじゃん！　オレ、気にいったよ！", "zh": "『威尔戈』！？哇──！听起来\n好像外援选手，帅呆了！我超喜欢的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "a3ea29c6fd43e10396ac21e5bff49c66f76fdbcc98ecd0d6ae2d2ee50819cddf", "ja": "昴……？　今{$P$}が、\nウィルゴはおとめ座って意味だって……。", "zh": "昴……？{$P$}他\n都说是星座的『处女座』了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "dfa38310669842ba267109f891f6c6935c7c28c82d3c703c322a2357ac07e9d9", "ja": "おとめ座……おとめ……。\nちょっと照れちゃいますけど、いいと思います！", "zh": "处女座……少女……\n虽然让人有点害羞，但我觉得不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "f81255138175897bd1aac896a304a63b9916e9fdc14d8f0653d0c8eeb5c3c7d1", "ja": "そうですね。……おとめ座の名前に、\n負けないステージにしなきゃ！　そのためにも……。", "zh": "是啊……我们的表演\n可不能辜负处女座这个名称！所以我们更要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1044_047sub", "source_sha256": "fde993e6cbee26a8c69e03cd511c912478d07016274d92a1a4ea2987acef750e", "ja": "恋の研究、だよな♪　みんな、がんばろうな！\nよーし、しまっていこー！", "zh": "研究爱情，对吧♪各位，我们一起加油吧！\n好～要加把劲啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "ff773f2d9dca567af0e47e7f12312fdd5dbcb505f9ee53369cea4d4cb31a3dd1", "ja": "お、おー……！？", "zh": "喔、喔……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "5fb65ea3e0c56fa6b17f9ca01f66019aaf63e3356d61b5f0a7ff935ad114be07", "ja": "え？　おー……！？", "zh": "咦？喔……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "06e61dcaad4e6359aa719313261cb6f9c72d59357852c43d10313707fb0b673e", "ja": "（『恋』か……ちょっと難しいテーマだけど、\nみんなやる気になってくれてるみたいだな）", "zh": "（『爱情』啊……这个题目虽然对她们来说有点难，\n但大家好像都很有干劲的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_01_1048_p", "source_sha256": "57e40da73fc44f5254b7ea74675ec4fac0d2e9c67aed6eeca891496cb319a2eb", "ja": "（恋の研究で、3人が歌に、自然と気持ちを\nこめられるようになってくれるといいな）", "zh": "（希望她们三人可以透过研究爱情，\n将那股情怀自然地融入歌曲中。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
